    "readOnlyHint": false
  },
  "description": "Declare the files you are about to edit, so another agent working the same repo finds out before both of you change them. Call it when several sessions share one checkout and you are starting on a set of files; a session in a checkout of its own does not need it. The lease is advisory: nothing is blocked, and any overlap with a lease another session holds comes back in conflicts, with the holder to message. It lapses on its own, so an agent that dies never holds the repo. Call release_files when you are done.",
  "inputSchema": {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "mode": {
        "description": "exclusive (default) means nobody else should edit these paths; shared means others may edit them too",
